From 263e7bb6370b3ada6dcb08bb47f89877c564ea10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JohnnyC96 <54557697+JohnnyC96@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:30:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 87/92] IOP: optional external DEV9 device (the 0x1000xxxx page
 and the revision register at their access widths, DMA 8 ended by the device,
 its interrupt INTC line 13, run with the IOP clock), dmacman slice DMA on
 channel 8 through it; runtime: PS2X_DEV9=pcsx2|off (default off) from the
 external library, PS2X_NET_IF, PS2X_NET_HOSTS

